var e=[{id:`en-practical-01`,category:`practical`,length:`medium`,difficulty:`medium`,text:`Boil the pasta in salted water for nine minutes. Meanwhile, fry the garlic in olive oil, add the tomatoes and let the sauce simmer. Mix everything and top with fresh basil.`},{id:`en-practical-02`,category:`practical`,length:`medium`,difficulty:`medium`,text:`Go straight for two blocks, then turn right at the pharmacy. The cafe is on the left, next to the bookshop. If you reach the bridge, you have gone too far.`},{id:`en-practical-03`,category:`practical`,length:`medium`,difficulty:`medium`,text:`Great little restaurant. The staff were friendly, the food came quickly and the portions were generous. The only downside was the noise, so book a table outside if you can.`},{id:`en-practical-04`,category:`practical`,length:`long`,difficulty:`hard`,text:`Thank you for contacting us. We are sorry that your order arrived damaged. We have sent a replacement today, free of charge, and it should reach you within three working days. You do not need to return the original item.`},{id:`en-practical-05`,category:`practical`,length:`medium`,difficulty:`easy`,text:`This backpack is light, waterproof and fits a 15-inch laptop. It has two side pockets and a hidden zip for your wallet.`},{id:`en-practical-06`,category:`practical`,length:`medium`,difficulty:`easy`,text:`To reset your password, open Settings, tap Account, and choose Change password. You will get an email with a link.`},{id:`en-practical-07`,category:`practical`,length:`medium`,difficulty:`medium`,text:`Mix the flour, sugar and a pinch of salt. Add two eggs and the milk, then whisk until smooth. Fry each pancake for about a minute on each side.`},{id:`en-practical-08`,category:`practical`,length:`medium`,difficulty:`easy`,text:`The apartment is on the third floor. The code for the gate is on the invoice, and the keys are in the box by the door.`},{id:`en-practical-09`,category:`practical`,length:`medium`,difficulty:`medium`,text:`Preheat the oven to 350 degrees. Line a baking tray with paper and bake the cookies for ten to twelve minutes, until golden at the edges.`},{id:`en-practical-10`,category:`practical`,length:`short`,difficulty:`easy`,text:`Take one tablet twice a day with food. Do not take more than two tablets in 24 hours.`},{id:`en-practical-11`,category:`practical`,length:`medium`,difficulty:`medium`,text:`From the station, take bus 12 towards the city center and get off at the fourth stop. The hotel is the white building across the street.`},{id:`en-practical-12`,category:`practical`,length:`medium`,difficulty:`medium`,text:`The headphones sound great and the battery lasts all day. However, they feel a bit tight after a few hours. Four stars out of five.`},{id:`en-practical-13`,category:`practical`,length:`short`,difficulty:`easy`,text:`Wash at 30 degrees with similar colors. Do not tumble dry. Iron on low heat.`},{id:`en-practical-14`,category:`practical`,length:`long`,difficulty:`hard`,text:`We are sorry to hear that you are not satisfied with your purchase. You can return the item within 30 days for a full refund. Please pack it in the original box and attach the return label that we have sent to your email address.`},{id:`en-practical-15`,category:`practical`,length:`medium`,difficulty:`medium`,text:`Chop the onion and fry it until soft. Add the rice, stir for a minute, then pour in the stock a little at a time.`},{id:`en-practical-16`,category:`practical`,length:`short`,difficulty:`easy`,text:`Closed for holidays from the 1st to the 15th. We look forward to seeing you again soon!`},{id:`en-practical-17`,category:`practical`,length:`medium`,difficulty:`medium`,text:`This lightweight jacket keeps out wind and rain. It folds into its own pocket, so it's easy to take anywhere.`},{id:`en-practical-18`,category:`practical`,length:`medium`,difficulty:`medium`,text:`To connect to the Wi-Fi, choose the network called Guest and enter the password printed on your receipt.`},{id:`en-practical-19`,category:`practical`,length:`medium`,difficulty:`medium`,text:`The room was clean and quiet, and the bed was very comfortable. Breakfast was simple but fresh. I would stay here again.`},{id:`en-practical-20`,category:`practical`,length:`long`,difficulty:`hard`,text:`Thank you for your message. Your booking for two nights from the fifth to the seventh is confirmed. Check-in starts at three in the afternoon, and breakfast is included. If you plan to arrive after ten in the evening, please let us know in advance so that we can leave the key at reception.`},{id:`en-practical-21`,category:`practical`,length:`short`,difficulty:`easy`,text:`Shake well before use. Keep in the fridge after opening and use within three days.`},{id:`en-practical-22`,category:`practical`,length:`medium`,difficulty:`medium`,text:`Turn off the water at the main tap before you start. Unscrew the old part, clean the thread and fit the new one by hand.`},{id:`en-practical-23`,category:`practical`,length:`medium`,difficulty:`medium`,text:`Hello, I'd like to book a table for four people on Saturday at eight. Do you have anything by the window?`},{id:`en-practical-24`,category:`practical`,length:`long`,difficulty:`hard`,text:`To make the dough, mix 500 grams of flour with a teaspoon of salt and a packet of dry yeast. Add warm water and two spoons of olive oil, then knead for ten minutes. Cover the bowl and leave it in a warm place for an hour, until the dough has doubled in size.`}];export{e as default};